# A1_V, the report: with all three Vivec informants heard, Caius promotes the
# player.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from a1_v_report
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case a1_v_report
run
player->PositionCell -35 -110 80 180 "Balmora, Caius Cosades' House"
until 600 GetPCCell "Balmora, Caius Cosades' House" == 1
talk caius cosades
ask Orders
expect GetJournalIndex A1_V_VivecInformants == 50
bye
end
